# This file exists because raw participant media (face video, audio,
# images) must NEVER enter this repository's git history under any
# circumstances -- history is permanent, and a repository that has ever
# contained such data is compromised for its whole life (CLAUDE.md
# guardrail G4). Everything below is excluded for that reason, for
# reproducibility (large model binaries -- see models/MODEL_MANIFEST.md),
# or because it is local/regenerable tooling state rather than a
# client-facing artefact. This file is present from the repository's
# first commit, deliberately, before any other content was added.

# --- Raw media, broad coverage by extension (see .githooks/pre-commit
# for the magic-byte check that backs this up) ---
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wmv
*.flv
*.m4v
*.mpg
*.mpeg
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.flac
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif
*.heic
*.webp
*.raw

# --- Capture/frame output directories, wherever they appear ---
frames/
frame_output/
captures/
recordings/
scratchpad/
batch_videos/

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
secrets.json

# --- Model bundles: large binary dependency, not source or output.
# Checksummed and documented in models/MODEL_MANIFEST.md, which IS
# committed -- that file is the reproducibility record; the binaries
# themselves are not. ---
models/*.task

# --- Raw/derived data logs. The manifest gets committed, not the data
# itself (CLAUDE.md TRAINING-GRADE DATA). See PROVENANCE.md for the open
# item on this directory's physical location.
#
# Pattern is `logs/*` + a negation, NOT a blanket `logs/` -- git cannot
# re-include a file inside a directory that the directory-level pattern
# itself excluded (a bare `logs/` stops git from even looking inside it),
# so the directory has to stay traversable and every individual file
# excluded instead. This is what lets logs/variant_log.jsonl be tracked
# (Gate 0 provenance log) while every other file in logs/ stays out. ---
logs/*
!logs/variant_log.jsonl

# --- Python / build artefacts ---
venv/
.venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# --- IDE / OS cruft ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local tooling state, not a client artefact ---
.claude/
